OL,3,GNEWSABaker makes 'mega' 10ft custard
OL,4,Aslice for couple's wedding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA baker said she has been inundated
OL,7,Fwith bookings after creating a special
OL,8,Fthree metre (9.8ft) custard slice for a
OL,9,Fcouple's special day.
OL,11,FFablas Ice Cream were booked to cater
OL,12,Fthe wedding of Liz and James Harding -
OL,13,Fwho say they are both "passionate about
OL,14,Fcustard" - in Brecon, Powys.
OL,16,FThe couple said the idea came after
OL,17,Fthey saw the custard slices on the
OL,18,Fcompany's social media, and thought
OL,19,Fthey would ask if a "mega" one could be
OL,20,Fmade.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
