OL,3,GNEWSABaker makes 'mega' 10ft custard
OL,4,Aslice for couple's wedding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company's managing director Lauren
OL,7,FEvent said it was probably the "biggest
OL,8,Fthing we've ever created", with the
OL,9,Fslabs produced at the bakery in
OL,10,FCowbridge and then transported to the
OL,11,Fevent, where it was assembled and
OL,12,Fdecorated.
